                            <li>Stability of 10 Beta-Lactam Antibiotics in Human Plasma at Different Storage Conditions - Erasmus University Rotterdam Repository, <a href="https://pure.eur.nl/ws/files/101002457/Stability_of_10_Beta-Lactam_Antibiotics_in_Human_Plasma_at_Different_Storage_Conditions.pdf" target="_blank">PDF Link</a></li>
                            <li>Determination of ceftriaxone in human plasma using liquid chromatography–tandem mass spectrometry - PMC, <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9379334/" target="_blank">PMC Link</a></li>
                            <li>Preanalytical Stability of 13 Antibiotics in Biological Samples: A Crucial Factor for Therapeutic Drug Monitoring - MDPI (Antibiotics), <a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2079-6382/13/7/675" target="_blank">MDPI Link</a></li>
                            <li>Preanalytical Stability of 13 Antibiotics in Biological Samples: A Crucial Factor for Therapeutic Drug Monitoring - ResearchGate, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/382490732_Preanalytical_Stability_of_13_Antibiotics_in_Biological_Samples_A_Crucial_Factor_for_Therapeutic_Drug_Monitoring" target="_blank">Link</a></li>
                            <li>Liquid chromatography–tandem mass spectrometry for the simultaneous quantitation of ceftriaxone, metronidazole and hydroxymetronidazole in plasma from seriously ill, severely malnourished children - PMC, <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5801568/" target="_blank">PMC Link</a></li>
                            <li>Therapeutic drug monitoring of beta-lactam antibiotics–Influence of sample handling and storage - Journal of Pharmaceutical and Biomedical Analysis, <a href="https://www.ovid.com/journals/jpaba/pdf/10.1016/j.jpba.2017.05.037~therapeutic-drug-monitoring-of-beta-lactam-antibiotics" target="_blank">Link</a></li>
                            <li>A Validated UHPLC–MS/MS Method to Quantify Eight Antibiotics in Quantitative Dried Blood Spots in Support of Pharmacokinetic Studies in Neonates - MDPI, <a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2079-6382/12/2/199" target="_blank">MDPI Link</a></li>
                            <li>Development of a Novel Multipenicillin Assay and Assessment of the Impact of Analyte Degradation: Lessons for Scavenged Sampling in Antimicrobial Pharmacokinetic Study Design - ASM Journals (AAC), <a href="https://journals.asm.org/doi/10.1128/aac.01540-17" target="_blank">ASM Link</a></li>
                            <li>Assessment of the stability of antimicrobials and resistance genes during short- and long-term storage condition: accounting for uncertainties in bioanalytical workflows - PMC, <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10556160/" target="_blank">PMC Link</a></li>
                            <li>Liquid chromatography with tandem mass spectrometric method for determination of 52 antibiotics in human whole blood and urine and application to forensic cases - ResearchGate, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/379962408_Liquid_chromatography_with_tandem_mass_spectrometric_method_for_determination_of_52_antibiotics_in_human_whole_blood_and_urine_and_application_to_forensic_cases" target="_blank">Link</a></li>
                            <li>A Laboratory Protocol for Routine Therapeutic Drug Monitoring of Beta-Lactams Antimicrobials in Horses and Dogs - MDPI, <a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2079-6382/14/4/390" target="_blank">MDPI Link</a></li>
                            <li>Pharmacokinetics of ceftriaxone in plasma and bone of patients undergoing hip or knee surgery - Journal of Pharmacy and Pharmacology, <a href="https://www.ovid.com/journals/jpap/pdf/10.1111/jphp.12282~pharmacokinetics-of-ceftriaxone-in-plasma-and-bone-of" target="_blank">Link</a></li>
                            <li>Prediction of Unbound Ceftriaxone Concentration in Children: Simple Bioanalysis Method and Basic Mathematical Equation - PMC, <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7927823/" target="_blank">PMC Link</a></li>
                            <li>Development of a UHPLC-UV/Vis Method for Simultaneously Determining Six Beta-Lactam Antibiotics in Plasma: A Tool for the Clinical Implementation of Therapeutic Monitoring of Beta-Lactams - MDPI, <a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2079-6382/14/6/613" target="_blank">MDPI Link</a></li>
                            <li>Piperacillin sodium, tazobactam sodium injection, powder, for solution - DailyMed - NIH, <a href="https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/lookup.cfm?setid=fc4d1e35-23eb-4654-8691-ae5bfd50a48a" target="_blank">DailyMed Link</a></li>
                            <li>ZOSYN (piperacillin and tazobactam for injection) - FDA Accessdata Prescribing Information, <a href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2009/065386lbl.pdf" target="_blank">FDA PDF Link</a></li>
                            <li>Tazocin 4 EF® PIPERACILLIN/TAZOBACTAM Powder For Solution For Injection Or Infusion CDS AfME - Pfizer Labeling, <a href="https://labeling.pfizer.com/ShowLabeling.aspx?id=16061" target="_blank">Pfizer Link</a></li>
                            <li>Therapeutic Drug Monitoring of Piperacillin and Tazobactam by RP-HPLC of Residual Blood Specimens - PMC, <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5970981/" target="_blank">PMC Link</a></li>
                            <li>Ampicillin Stability in a Portable Elastomeric Infusion Pump: A Step Forward in Outpatient Parenteral Antimicrobial Therapy - MDPI (Pharmaceutics), <a href="https://www.mdpi.com/1999-4923/15/8/2099" target="_blank">MDPI Link</a></li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3: 本ツールの操作マニュアル & 運用フロー -->
            <div class="guide-card">
                <h3 class="guide-title">3. 本ツールの機能一覧・操作マニュアル</h3>
                
                <h4 class="guide-sub-title">A. 症例管理ワークフロー（タブの役割）</h4>
                <table class="guide-table">
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width:20%;">タブ名称</th>
                        <th style="width:80%;">主な用途と運用手順</th>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-weight:bold; background:#eef2f5;">① スクリーニング</td>
                        <td>
                            院内処方データを取り込んだ直後の全候補患者が登録されます。<br>
                            ・「最新情報再取得」で全病棟を高速チェックし、他病棟へ移動・退院した患者を自動判定します。<br>
                            ・「表示リストを一括取得」でカルテから年齢や採血予定日を自動収集します。<br>
                            ・適格基準に合致した患者は「<strong>対象へ</strong>」ボタンで対象症例タブへ移動し、除外例は「<strong>候補外へ</strong>」で整理します。
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-weight:bold; background:#eef2f5;">② 対象症例</td>
                        <td>
                            同意取得〜採血〜提出まで進める本研究の本登録患者を管理します。<br>
                            ・患者行の進捗バッジ（同未・同済・採血・処理・冷凍・提出）および医師ToDo・署名・連絡・回覧をクリックして進捗状況を記録します。<br>
                            ・当日に採血予定がある患者は画面上部に「<strong>当日採血アラート</strong>」が表示されます。
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-weight:bold; background:#eef2f5;">③ 候補外</td>
                        <td>
                            中止・除外基準に該当した患者や、同意が得られなかった患者の保管場所です。<br>
                            ・誤って移動した場合でも「<strong>スクへ戻す</strong>」ボタンでいつでもスクリーニングへ復帰できます。
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-weight:bold; background:#e8f4f8;">④ 集計・進捗</td>
                        <td>
                            対象症例タブのデータを基に、3薬剤（セフトリアキソン、ユナスピン、タゾピペ）× 3年齢区分（非高齢者、高齢者、超高齢者）ごとの進捗状況（ステータス別症例数）を自動集計・ダッシュボード表示します。
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-weight:bold; background:#e8f8ec;">⑤ CRF編集</td>
                        <td>
                            ステータスが「提出済」または「冷凍」となった患者のみが自動抽出されるCRF（症例報告書）データシートです。<br>
                            ・「＋列を追加」「編集」「削除」「◀/▶並び替え」で臨床検査値（血清クレアチニン、eGFR、Alb等）や患者背景の入力列を自由にカスタマイズできます。<br>
                            ・入力したCRFデータは「CRFをCSV出力」ボタンでいつでもExcel形式で書き出し可能です。
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <h4 class="guide-sub-title">B. 上部ボタン・各種ツール機能の使い方</h4>
                <ul style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.8; margin-top:5px; padding-left:20px; color:#333;">
                    <li><strong>処方統計データ読み込み (Excel/CSV):</strong> 院内の注射処方統計ファイルをドラッグまたは選択して取り込みます。同一患者・同一薬剤で連続している処方は自動的に統合されます。</li>
                    <li><strong>最新情報（病棟/科/医）を再取得:</strong> 全11病棟（3A・3B, NICU, 3C, 4B, 4C, 5A, 5B, 5C, 6A, 6B, 6C）の名簿を裏で高速確認（約3〜5秒）し、転棟（例: 3C→6A）を自動検知します。名簿にない患者は「他病棟/退院」として自動更新されます。</li>
                    <li><strong>表示リストを一括取得:</strong> 現在画面に表示されている患者全員のカルテ情報を巡回し、生年月日（実年齢）と次回採血予定日（生化学・一般等のオーダ）を自動取得します。</li>
                    <li><strong>一括確認(年齢+採血) (各行のボタン):</strong> 特定の患者1名のみの生年月日・採血予定日、および最新の診療科・主治医を取得します。</li>
                    <li><strong>現在の管理一覧をCSV出力:</strong> 画面上で絞り込んでいるタブ・病棟・年齢区分・薬剤・ステータス・検索キーワードの条件を100%保持したままCSV（Shift_JIS）を出力し、自動的にExcelで起動します。最新の病棟・診療科・主治医の変更も反映されます。</li>
                </ul>

                <h4 class="guide-sub-title">C. ステータス・確認状況バッジの定義</h4>
                <div style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.8; margin-top:5px;">
                    <div style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                        <strong>【進捗ステータス】</strong><br>
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#f1c40f;">同未</span> 同意未取得（説明準備中） &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#3498db;">同済</span> 同意取得済 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#e74c3c;">採血</span> 採血完了 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#9b59b6;">処理</span> 遠心・分注処理完了 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#1abc9c;">冷凍</span> -80℃冷凍保管中 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#2ecc71;">提出</span> 測定提出完了（CRF対象）
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>【確認状況（医師・検査連携）】</strong><br>
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#34495e;">TD</span> 医師ToDo入力済 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#34495e;">署名</span> 医師同意書署名受領済 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#34495e;">連絡</span> 検査室（採血時対応）事前連絡済 &nbsp;|&nbsp;
                        <span class="guide-badge-box" style="background:#34495e;">回覧</span> 検査科CoMedix回覧・確認済
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
    </div><!-- /#app-main-area -->
</div>

<script>
    var fso;
    var folderPath = "";
    var backupDir = "";
    var dataFilePath = "pk_study_crf_data.json";
    var colsFilePath = "pk_study_crf_columns.json";
    try {
        fso = new ActiveXObject("Scripting.FileSystemObject");
        var htaPath = unescape(location.pathname).replace(/^\/([a-zA-Z]:)/, '$1').replace(/\//g, '\\');
        folderPath = fso.GetParentFolderName(htaPath);
        backupDir = folderPath + "\\バックアップ";
        
        if (!fso.FolderExists(backupDir)) {
            fso.CreateFolder(backupDir);
        }

        dataFilePath = backupDir + "\\pk_study_crf_data.json";
        colsFilePath = backupDir + "\\pk_study_crf_columns.json";

        var oldDataFilePath = folderPath + "\\pk_study_crf_data.json";
        var oldColsFilePath = folderPath + "\\pk_study_crf_columns.json";
        
        if (fso.FileExists(oldDataFilePath) && !fso.FileExists(dataFilePath)) {
            fso.MoveFile(oldDataFilePath, dataFilePath);
        }
        if (fso.FileExists(oldColsFilePath) && !fso.FileExists(colsFilePath)) {
            fso.MoveFile(oldColsFilePath, colsFilePath);
        }
    } catch(e) {}

    function toHalfWidth(str) {
        if (!str) return "";
        return str.replace(/[Ａ-Ｚａ-ｚ０-９]/g, function(s) {
            return String.fromCharCode(s.charCodeAt(0) - 0xFEE0);
        });
    }

    function autoExcludeOldPatients(dataObj) {
        var todayTime = new Date().getTime();
        for (var k in dataObj) {
            if (dataObj.hasOwnProperty(k)) {
                var p = dataObj[k];
                if ((p.tab || "screening") === "screening") {
                    var eDate = new Date(p.end).getTime();
                    if (!isNaN(eDate)) {
                        var daysDiff = (todayTime - eDate) / (1000 * 3600 * 24);
                        if (daysDiff > 30) {
                            p.tab = "exclude";
                            p.remarks = p.remarks ? p.remarks + "\n[自動] 投与終了から1ヶ月以上経過" : "[自動] 投与終了から1ヶ月以上経過";
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    function loadData() {
        if (!fso) return {};
        try {
            if (fso.FileExists(dataFilePath)) {
                var ts = fso.OpenTextFile(dataFilePath, 1, false, -2);
                if (!ts.AtEndOfStream) {
                    var text = ts.ReadAll();
                    ts.Close();
                    if (text) {
                        var parsed = JSON.parse(text);
                        var migrated = {};
                        
                        for (var k in parsed) {
                            var p = parsed[k];
                            
                            // Migrate status from number to explicit string
                            if (typeof p.status === "number") {
                                if (p.tab === undefined) {
                                    // very old data
                                    if (p.status === 6) p.status = "";
                                    else if (p.status === 5) { p.status = ""; p.tab = "exclude"; }
                                    else {
                                        var origLabels = ["同意未", "同意済", "採血済", "処理済", "提出済"];
                                        p.status = origLabels[p.status] || "";
                                    }
                                } else {
                                    // old data with tabs
                                    if (p.status === 0) p.status = "";
                                    else {
                                        var currLabels = ["", "同意未", "同意済", "採血済", "処理済", "提出済"];
                                        p.status = currLabels[p.status] || "";
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                            if (!p.status) p.status = "";
                            
                            // Normalize existing ward data
                            if (p.ward) {
                                p.ward = toHalfWidth(String(p.ward)).toUpperCase().replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '');
                                if (p.ward === "3A" || p.ward === "3B") p.ward = "3A・3B";
                            }
                            if (p.currentWard) {
                                p.currentWard = toHalfWidth(String(p.currentWard)).toUpperCase().replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '');
                                if (p.currentWard === "3A" || p.currentWard === "3B") p.currentWard = "3A・3B";
                            }
                            
                            if (p.drug && p.drug.indexOf(" / ") !== -1) {
                                var drugs = p.drug.split(" / ");
                                for(var i=0; i<drugs.length; i++) {
                                    var newKey = p.id + "_" + drugs[i];
                                    var pCopy = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(p));
                                    pCopy.drug = drugs[i];
                                    migrated[newKey] = pCopy;
                                }
                            } else {
                                if (k.indexOf("_") === -1) {
                                    var newKey = p.id + "_" + p.drug;
                                    migrated[newKey] = p;
                                } else {
                                    migrated[k] = p;
                                }
                            }
                        }
                        
                        autoExcludeOldPatients(migrated);
                        
                        try {
                            var d = new Date();
                            var y = d.getFullYear();
                            var m = d.getMonth() + 1;
                            var day = d.getDate();
                            var weekOfMonth = Math.ceil(day / 7);
                            var mStr = m < 10 ? '0' + m : m;
                            if (!fso.FolderExists(backupDir)) {
                                fso.CreateFolder(backupDir);
                            }
                            var backupFileName = backupDir + "\\backup_pk_study_" + y + mStr + "_W" + weekOfMonth + ".json";
                            if (!fso.FileExists(backupFileName)) {
                                fso.CopyFile(dataFilePath, backupFileName, false);
                            }
                        } catch(err) {}

                        return migrated;
                    }
                }
                ts.Close();
            }
        } catch(e) {}
        return {};
    }

    function saveDataToFile() {
        if (!fso) return;
        try {
            var ts = fso.OpenTextFile(dataFilePath, 2, true, -2);
            ts.Write(JSON.stringify(patientData));
            ts.Close();
        } catch(e) {}
    }

    var patientData = loadData();
    var statusLabels = ["同意未", "同意済", "採血済", "処理済", "冷凍", "提出済"];
    var statusAbbr = ["同未", "同済", "採血", "処理", "冷凍", "提出"];
    var subStatusLabels = ["医師ToDo済", "医師署名済", "検査連絡済", "検査CoMedix回覧済"];
    var subStatusAbbr = ["TD", "署名", "連絡", "回覧"];

    var crfColumns = [];
    
    function loadColumns() {
        if (!fso) return;
        try {
            if (fso.FileExists(colsFilePath)) {
                var ts = fso.OpenTextFile(colsFilePath, 1, false, -2);
                if (!ts.AtEndOfStream) {
                    crfColumns = JSON.parse(ts.ReadAll());
                }
                ts.Close();
            }
        } catch(e) {}
    }
    
    function saveColumns() {
        if (!fso) return;
        try {
            var ts = fso.OpenTextFile(colsFilePath, 2, true, -2);
            ts.Write(JSON.stringify(crfColumns));
            ts.Close();
        } catch(e) {}
    }
    
    loadColumns();
    var currentTab = "screening"; 
    
    var fetchQueue = [];
    var isFetchingAll = false;
    var currentSortCol = "";
    var currentSortAsc = true;
    
    var msFilters = { age: {}, drug: {}, status: {}, dept: {} };

    function escapeHtml(str) {
        if (!str) return "";
        return String(str).replace(/[&<>"']/g, function(match) {
            return { '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#39;' }[match];
        });
    }

    function parseCSVLine(text) {
        var ret = [];
        var inQuote = false;
        var val = "";
        for (var i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {
            var c = text.charAt(i);
            if (inQuote) {
                if (c === '"') {
                    if (i + 1 < text.length && text.charAt(i + 1) === '"') {
                        val += '"'; i++;
                    } else {
                        inQuote = false;
                    }
                } else {
                    val += c;
                }
            } else {
                if (c === '"') {
                    inQuote = true;
                } else if (c === ',') {
                    ret.push(val); val = "";
                } else {
                    val += c;
                }
            }
        }
        ret.push(val);
        return ret;
    }

    function formatDateString(strOrDate) {
        if (!strOrDate) return "";
        var d = new Date(strOrDate);
        if (isNaN(d.getTime())) return String(strOrDate); 
        var y = d.getFullYear();
        var m = d.getMonth() + 1;
        var day = d.getDate();
        return y + '-' + (m < 10 ? '0' + m : m) + '-' + (day < 10 ? '0' + day : day);
    }

    function calculateAgeAtStart(birthDateStr, startDateStr) {
        if (!birthDateStr || !startDateStr) return null;
        var bStr = birthDateStr.replace(/[\/\年\月]/g, "/").replace(/日/g, "");
        var sStr = startDateStr.replace(/[\/\年\月]/g, "/").replace(/日/g, "");
        var b = new Date(bStr);
        var s = new Date(sStr);
        if(isNaN(b.getTime()) || isNaN(s.getTime())) return null;
        var age = s.getFullYear() - b.getFullYear();
        var m = s.getMonth() - b.getMonth();
        if (m < 0 || (m === 0 && s.getDate() < b.getDate())) {
            age--;
        }
        return age;
    }

    function getAgeGroup(age) {
        if(age === null || age === undefined || age === "") return "";
        if(age <= 17) return "対象外";
        if(age <= 64) return "非高齢者";
        if(age <= 84) return "高齢者";
        return "超高齢者";
    }

    document.getElementById('dataFile').onchange = function(e) {
        var fileInput = document.getElementById('dataFile');
        var filePath = fileInput.value; 
        var file = e.target.files[0];
        if (!file) return;

        var fileName = file.name.toLowerCase();
        
        if (fileName.indexOf(".xls") !== -1) {
            try {
                var excel = new ActiveXObject("Excel.Application");
                excel.Visible = false;
                excel.DisplayAlerts = false;
                var book = excel.Workbooks.Open(filePath);
                var sheet = book.Worksheets(1);
                var usedRange = sheet.UsedRange;
                var rowsCount = usedRange.Rows.Count;
                var colsCount = usedRange.Columns.Count;
                
                var val = usedRange.Value;
                var dataRows = [];
                
                if (rowsCount === 1 && colsCount === 1) {
                    dataRows.push([val != null ? String(val) : ""]);
                } else {
                    var vbarray = new VBArray(val).toArray();
                    var index = 0;
                    for(var r=0; r<rowsCount; r++) {
                        var rowData = [];
                        for(var c=0; c<colsCount; c++) {
                            var cellVal = vbarray[index++];
                            rowData.push(cellVal != null ? String(cellVal) : "");
                        }
                        dataRows.push(rowData);
                    }
                }
                
                book.Close(false);
                excel.Quit();
                excel = null;
                
                processDataRows(dataRows, 1);
            } catch(err) {
                alert("Excelファイルの読み込みに失敗しました。\nExcelがインストールされているか、ファイルが使用中でないか確認してください。\n詳細: " + err.message);
            }
            fileInput.value = "";
        } else {
            var reader = new FileReader();
            reader.onload = function(event) {
                try {
                    var text = event.target.result;
                    var lines = text.split(/\r\n|\n|\r/);
                    var dataRows = [];
                    for (var i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {
                        if (!lines[i] || lines[i].replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') === "") continue;
                        dataRows.push(parseCSVLine(lines[i]));
                    }
                    processDataRows(dataRows, 1);
                } catch(err) {
                    alert("CSVの解析中にエラーが発生しました。\nエラー詳細: " + err.message);
                }
                fileInput.value = "";
            };
            reader.readAsText(file, 'Shift-JIS'); 
        }
    };

    function processDataRows(dataRows, startIndex) {
        var addedCount = 0;

        var sessionCounts = {};
        for (var i = startIndex; i < dataRows.length; i++) {
            var cols = dataRows[i];
            if (cols.length < 6) continue;
            var s_id = cols[5] ? String(cols[5]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            var s_rawDate = cols[4] ? cols[4] : "";
            var s_date = formatDateString(s_rawDate);
            var s_drugStr = cols[1] ? String(cols[1]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            if (!s_id || !s_drugStr) continue;
            
            var s_drugs = s_drugStr.split(/\s*[\/／]\s*/);
            for(var dIdx=0; dIdx<s_drugs.length; dIdx++) {
                var s_drug = s_drugs[dIdx];
                if (!s_drug) continue;
                var sKey = s_id + "_" + s_drug + "_" + s_date;
                sessionCounts[sKey] = (sessionCounts[sKey] || 0) + 1;
            }
        }

        for (var i = startIndex; i < dataRows.length; i++) {
            var cols = dataRows[i];
            if (cols.length < 6) continue;

            var drugStr = cols[1] ? String(cols[1]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            var rawDate = cols[4] ? cols[4] : "";
            var date = formatDateString(rawDate);
            var id = cols[5] ? String(cols[5]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            var name = cols[6] ? String(cols[6]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            
            var department = cols.length > 7 && cols[7] ? String(cols[7]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            var doctor = cols.length > 8 && cols[8] ? String(cols[8]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            var ward = cols.length > 9 && cols[9] ? String(cols[9]).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '') : "";
            ward = toHalfWidth(ward).toUpperCase();
            if (ward === "3A" || ward === "3B") ward = "3A・3B";

            if (!id) continue;
            
            var drugs = drugStr.split(/\s*[\/／]\s*/);
            
            for(var dIdx=0; dIdx<drugs.length; dIdx++) {
                var drug = drugs[dIdx];
                if (!drug) continue;
                addedCount++;

                var baseKey = id + "_" + drug; 
                var episodes = [];
                for (var k in patientData) {
                    if (patientData.hasOwnProperty(k) && (k === baseKey || k.indexOf(baseKey + "_") === 0)) {
                        episodes.push(k);
                    }
                }
                
                var matchedKey = null;
                var incomingDate = new Date(date).getTime();
                
                if (!isNaN(incomingDate)) {
                    for (var e = 0; e < episodes.length; e++) {
                        var epKey = episodes[e];
                        var epStart = new Date(patientData[epKey].start).getTime();
                        var epEnd = new Date(patientData[epKey].end).getTime();
                        
                        var diffStart = (epStart - incomingDate) / (1000 * 3600 * 24);
                        var diffEnd = (incomingDate - epEnd) / (1000 * 3600 * 24);
                        
                        if (diffStart <= 3 && diffEnd <= 3) {
                            matchedKey = epKey;
                            break;
                        }
                    }
                }
                
                if (isNaN(incomingDate) && episodes.length > 0) {
                    matchedKey = episodes[0];
                }

                if (!matchedKey) {
                    var newKey = baseKey;
                    if (episodes.length > 0) {
                        var counter = episodes.length + 1;
                        while(patientData[baseKey + "_" + counter]) { counter++; }
                        newKey = baseKey + "_" + counter;
                    }
                    patientData[newKey] = {
                        id: id, name: name, drug: drug,
                        department: department, doctor: doctor, ward: ward,
                        start: date, end: date,
                        status: "", // 未選択
                        sampleDate: "", bloodDetail: "", remarks: "",
                        tab: "screening", birthDate: "", age: null, ageGroup: "",
                        freq: sessionCounts[id + "_" + drug + "_" + date] || 1
                    };
                } else {
                    var key = matchedKey;
                    var newDate = new Date(date);
                    
                    if (!isNaN(newDate.getTime())) {
                        var currentEnd = new Date(patientData[key].end);
                        if (isNaN(currentEnd.getTime()) || newDate >= currentEnd) {
                            if (department) patientData[key].department = department;
                            if (doctor) patientData[key].doctor = doctor;
                            if (ward) patientData[key].ward = ward;
                        } else {
                            if (!patientData[key].department && department) patientData[key].department = department;
                            if (!patientData[key].doctor && doctor) patientData[key].doctor = doctor;
                            if (!patientData[key].ward && ward) patientData[key].ward = ward;
                        }
                        
                        if (newDate < new Date(patientData[key].start)) patientData[key].start = date;
                        if (newDate > currentEnd) patientData[key].end = date;
                    } else {
                        patientData[key].department = department || patientData[key].department;
                        patientData[key].doctor = doctor || patientData[key].doctor;
                        patientData[key].ward = ward || patientData[key].ward;
                    }
                    
                    if (patientData[key].birthDate) {
                        patientData[key].age = calculateAgeAtStart(patientData[key].birthDate, patientData[key].start);
                        patientData[key].ageGroup = getAgeGroup(patientData[key].age);
                    }
                    
                    var currentSKey = id + "_" + drug + "_" + date;
                    patientData[key].freq = Math.max(patientData[key].freq || 0, sessionCounts[currentSKey] || 1);
                }
            }
        }
        
        autoExcludeOldPatients(patientData);
        saveDataToFile();
        updateHeaderFilters(true);
        updateWardCheckboxes();
        renderTable();
        alert("データの取り込みが完了しました。\n有効データ行数: " + addedCount);
    }

    var isFilterPanelOpen = true;

    function toggleFilterPanel() {
        var panel = document.getElementById("filterPanelWrap");
        var btn = document.getElementById("btnToggleFilter");
        if (!panel) return;
        isFilterPanelOpen = !isFilterPanelOpen;
        if (isFilterPanelOpen) {
            panel.style.display = "block";
            if (btn) btn.innerText = "▲ 絞り込みを閉じる";
        } else {
            panel.style.display = "none";
            if (btn) btn.innerText = "▼ 病棟絞り込みを開く";
        }
        setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 30);
    }

    function toggleRefList() {
        var container = document.getElementById("refListContainer");
        var btn = document.getElementById("btnToggleRef");
        if (!container) return;
        if (container.style.display === "none") {
            container.style.display = "block";
            if (btn) btn.innerText = "▲ 参考文献一覧を閉じる (25文献)";
        } else {
            container.style.display = "none";
            if (btn) btn.innerText = "▼ 参考文献一覧を表示 (TDM血清・血漿検体安定性 25文献)";
        }
    }

    function fixTableHeader() {
        var wrap = document.getElementById("tableScrollWrap");
        if (!wrap) return;
        var st = wrap.scrollTop;
        var table = document.getElementById("patientTable");
        if (!table) return;
        var ths = table.getElementsByTagName("th");
        for (var i = 0; i < ths.length; i++) {
            ths[i].style.top = st + "px";
        }
    }

    function fixCrfTableHeader() {
        var wrap = document.getElementById("crfTableScrollWrap");
        if (!wrap) return;
        var st = wrap.scrollTop;
        var table = document.getElementById("crfTable");
        if (!table) return;
        var ths = table.getElementsByTagName("th");
        for (var i = 0; i < ths.length; i++) {
            ths[i].style.top = st + "px";
        }
    }

    function updateLayoutHeights() {
        var headerArea = document.getElementById("app-header-area");
        if (!headerArea) return;
        
        var winH = document.documentElement.clientHeight || window.innerHeight;
        var headerH = headerArea.offsetHeight;
        var topOffset = headerArea.offsetTop || 8;
        var avH = winH - topOffset - headerH - 10;
        if (avH < 150) avH = 150;

        // 1. テーブルスクロール領域（スクリーニング、対象症例、候補外）
        var tableWrap = document.getElementById("tableScrollWrap");
        if (tableWrap) {
            tableWrap.style.height = avH + "px";
            fixTableHeader();
        }

        // 2. 集計ビュー
        var summaryView = document.getElementById("summary-view");
        if (summaryView) {
            summaryView.style.height = avH + "px";
        }

        // 3. CRFビュー
        var crfView = document.getElementById("crf-view");
        if (crfView) {
            crfView.style.height = avH + "px";
            var crfCtrl = document.getElementById("crf-controls-area");
            var ctrlH = crfCtrl ? (crfCtrl.offsetHeight + 10) : 45;
            var crfWrap = document.getElementById("crfTableScrollWrap");
            if (crfWrap) {
                var crfAvH = avH - ctrlH - 20;
                if (crfAvH < 120) crfAvH = 120;
                crfWrap.style.height = crfAvH + "px";
                fixCrfTableHeader();
            }
        }

        // 4. 研究ガイドビュー
        var guideView = document.getElementById("guide-view");
        if (guideView) {
            guideView.style.height = avH + "px";
        }
    }

    function updateTableContainerHeight() {
        updateLayoutHeights();
    }
    window.onresize = updateLayoutHeights;

    function switchTab(tabName) {
        currentTab = tabName;
        document.getElementById("tab-screening").className = (tabName === "screening") ? "tab-btn active" : "tab-btn";
        document.getElementById("tab-target").className = (tabName === "target") ? "tab-btn active" : "tab-btn";
        document.getElementById("tab-exclude").className = (tabName === "exclude") ? "tab-btn active" : "tab-btn";
        document.getElementById("tab-summary").className = (tabName === "summary") ? "tab-btn active" : "tab-btn";
        document.getElementById("tab-crf").className = (tabName === "crf") ? "tab-btn active" : "tab-btn";
        var tabGuide = document.getElementById("tab-guide");
        if (tabGuide) tabGuide.className = (tabName === "guide") ? "tab-btn active" : "tab-btn";

        var filterPanel = document.getElementById("filterPanelWrap");
        var headerTools = document.getElementById("header-tools");
        var guideView = document.getElementById("guide-view");
        
        if (tabName === "summary") {
            document.getElementById("table-view").style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("crf-view").style.display = "none";
            if (guideView) guideView.style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("summary-view").style.display = "block";
            if(filterPanel) filterPanel.style.display = "none";
            if(headerTools) headerTools.style.display = "none";
            renderSummary();
            setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 30);
        } else if (tabName === "crf") {
            document.getElementById("table-view").style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("summary-view").style.display = "none";
            if (guideView) guideView.style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("crf-view").style.display = "block";
            if(filterPanel) filterPanel.style.display = "none";
            if(headerTools) headerTools.style.display = "none";
            renderCRF();
            setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 30);
        } else if (tabName === "guide") {
            document.getElementById("table-view").style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("summary-view").style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("crf-view").style.display = "none";
            if (guideView) guideView.style.display = "block";
            if(filterPanel) filterPanel.style.display = "none";
            if(headerTools) headerTools.style.display = "none";
            setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 30);
        } else {
            document.getElementById("summary-view").style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("crf-view").style.display = "none";
            if (guideView) guideView.style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("table-view").style.display = "block";
            if(filterPanel) filterPanel.style.display = isFilterPanelOpen ? "block" : "none";
            if(headerTools) headerTools.style.display = "inline";
            renderTable();
            setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 30);
        }
    }

    function moveTab(key, targetTab) {
        patientData[key].tab = targetTab;
        saveAndRender();
    }

    function parseDateStr(str) {
        if (!str) return null;
        var parts = str.split("-");
        if (parts.length !== 3) return null;
        var y = parseInt(parts[0], 10);
        var m = parseInt(parts[1], 10) - 1;
        var d = parseInt(parts[2], 10);
        if (isNaN(y) || isNaN(m) || isNaN(d)) return null;
        return new Date(y, m, d);
    }

    function updateStatus(key, valStr) {
        if (patientData[key].status === valStr) {
            patientData[key].status = ""; // Toggle off to unselected
        } else {
            patientData[key].status = valStr;
            if (valStr === "冷凍") {
                var d = new Date();
                var y = d.getFullYear();
                var m = d.getMonth() + 1;
                var day = d.getDate();
                var todayStr = y + '-' + (m < 10 ? '0' + m : m) + '-' + (day < 10 ? '0' + day : day);
                if (!patientData[key].freezeDate || patientData[key].freezeDate === "") {
                    patientData[key].freezeDate = (patientData[key].sampleDate && patientData[key].sampleDate !== "") ? patientData[key].sampleDate : todayStr;
                }
            }
        }
        saveAndRender();
    }

    function toggleSubStatus(key, subKey) {
        if (!patientData[key].subStatus) {
            patientData[key].subStatus = {};
        }
        patientData[key].subStatus[subKey] = !patientData[key].subStatus[subKey];
        saveAndRender();
    }

    function updateSampleDate(key, dateVal) {
        var oldDate = patientData[key].sampleDate;
        patientData[key].sampleDate = dateVal;
        patientData[key].bloodDetail = "手動";
        if (patientData[key].status === "冷凍" && (!patientData[key].freezeDate || patientData[key].freezeDate === oldDate)) {
            patientData[key].freezeDate = dateVal;
        }
        saveAndRender();
    }

    function updateRemarks(key, textVal) {
        patientData[key].remarks = textVal;
        saveDataToFile(); 
    }

    function saveAndRender() {
        saveDataToFile();
        updateWardCheckboxes();
        renderTable();
    }

    function expandTextarea(el) {
        if (el.getAttribute("data-expanded") === "true") {
            el.style.height = '45px';
            el.setAttribute("data-expanded", "false");
        } else {
            el.style.height = 'auto';
            el.style.height = (el.scrollHeight + 5) + 'px';
            el.setAttribute("data-expanded", "true");
        }
    }

    function clearData() {
        if(confirm("すべての管理データを消去します。よろしいですか？（※復元できません）")) {
            patientData = {};
            if (fso && fso.FileExists(dataFilePath)) {
                try { fso.DeleteFile(dataFilePath); } catch(e) {}
            }
            saveAndRender();
        }
    }

    function sortTable(col) {
        if (currentSortCol === col) currentSortAsc = !currentSortAsc;
        else { currentSortCol = col; currentSortAsc = true; }
        renderTable();
    }

    function toggleMs(id, e) {
        if(e) e.stopPropagation();
        var content = null;
        if (id) content = document.getElementById(id + "-content");
        var isShowing = content && content.style.display === "block";
        
        var allContents = document.getElementsByClassName("ms-content");
        for (var i = 0; i < allContents.length; i++) {
            allContents[i].style.display = "none";
        }
        
        if (!isShowing && content) {
            content.style.display = "block";
        }
    }
    
    document.onclick = function(e) {
        var evt = e || window.event;
        var t = evt.target || evt.srcElement;
        if (t && typeof t.className === "string" && t.className.indexOf('ms-btn') !== -1) {
            return;
        }
        toggleMs('');
    };

    function updateMsFilter(filterType, val, isChecked) {
        if (isChecked) msFilters[filterType][val] = true;
        else delete msFilters[filterType][val];
        renderTable();
    }

    function clearMsFilter(filterType) {
        msFilters[filterType] = {};
        updateHeaderFilters(true);
        renderTable();
    }

    function updateHeaderFilters(forceRebuild) {
        var drugContent = document.getElementById("ms-drug-content");
        if (!forceRebuild && drugContent.innerHTML !== "") return;

        // Age
        var ages = ["非高齢者", "高齢者", "超高齢者", "対象外"];
        var html = '<div style="margin-bottom:5px;"><button onclick="clearMsFilter(\'age\')" style="font-size:9px; width:100%;">全クリア</button></div>';
        for(var i=0; i<ages.length; i++) {
            var chk = msFilters.age[ages[i]] ? "checked" : "";
            html += '<label><input type="checkbox" value="' + ages[i] + '" ' + chk + ' onchange="updateMsFilter(\'age\', this.value, this.checked)"> ' + ages[i] + '</label>';
        }
        html += '<button class="ms-close" onclick="toggleMs(\'\')">閉じる</button>';
        document.getElementById("ms-age-content").innerHTML = html;

        // Dept
        var deptContent = document.getElementById("ms-dept-content");
        var deptMap = {};
        for (var key in patientData) {
            if(patientData.hasOwnProperty(key)) {
                var dep = patientData[key].department || "(未登録)";
                deptMap[dep] = true;
            }
        }
        var sortedDepts = Object.keys(deptMap).sort();
        var htmlDept = '<div style="margin-bottom:5px;"><button onclick="clearMsFilter(\'dept\')" style="font-size:9px; width:100%;">全クリア</button></div>';
        for(var i=0; i<sortedDepts.length; i++) {
            var d = sortedDepts[i];
            var chk = msFilters.dept[d] ? "checked" : "";
            htmlDept += '<label><input type="checkbox" value="' + escapeHtml(d) + '" ' + chk + ' onchange="updateMsFilter(\'dept\', this.value, this.checked)"> ' + escapeHtml(d) + '</label>';
        }
        htmlDept += '<button class="ms-close" onclick="toggleMs(\'\')">閉じる</button>';
        deptContent.innerHTML = htmlDept;

        // Drug
        var drugsMap = {};
        for (var key in patientData) {
            if(patientData.hasOwnProperty(key)) drugsMap[patientData[key].drug] = true;
        }
        var sortedDrugs = Object.keys(drugsMap).sort();
        html = '<div style="margin-bottom:5px;"><button onclick="clearMsFilter(\'drug\')" style="font-size:9px; width:100%;">全クリア</button></div>';
        for(var i=0; i<sortedDrugs.length; i++) {
            var d = sortedDrugs[i];
            var chk = msFilters.drug[d] ? "checked" : "";
            html += '<label><input type="checkbox" value="' + escapeHtml(d) + '" ' + chk + ' onchange="updateMsFilter(\'drug\', this.value, this.checked)"> ' + escapeHtml(d) + '</label>';
        }
        html += '<button class="ms-close" onclick="toggleMs(\'\')">閉じる</button>';
        drugContent.innerHTML = html;

        // Status
        html = '<div style="margin-bottom:5px;"><button onclick="clearMsFilter(\'status\')" style="font-size:9px; width:100%;">全クリア</button></div>';
        
        var chkUnsel = msFilters.status[""] ? "checked" : "";
        html += '<label><input type="checkbox" value="" ' + chkUnsel + ' onchange="updateMsFilter(\'status\', this.value, this.checked)"> 未選択</label>';
        
        for(var i=0; i<statusLabels.length; i++) {
            var chk = msFilters.status[statusLabels[i]] ? "checked" : "";
            html += '<label><input type="checkbox" value="' + statusLabels[i] + '" ' + chk + ' onchange="updateMsFilter(\'status\', this.value, this.checked)"> ' + statusLabels[i] + '</label>';
        }
        html += '<button class="ms-close" onclick="toggleMs(\'\')">閉じる</button>';
        document.getElementById("ms-status-content").innerHTML = html;
    }

    function updateWardCheckboxes() {
        var container = document.getElementById("wardFilterContainer");
        if(!container) return;
        
        var existingChecks = document.getElementsByClassName('ward-cb');
        var checkedWards = {};
        for(var i=0; i<existingChecks.length; i++) {
            if(existingChecks[i].checked) checkedWards[existingChecks[i].value] = true;
        }

        var predefinedOrder = ["3A・3B", "NICU", "3C", "4B", "4C", "5A", "5B", "5C", "6A", "6B", "6C", "外来"];
        var otherWards = {};
        
        for (var key in patientData) {
            if (patientData.hasOwnProperty(key) && patientData[key].ward) {
                var w = patientData[key].ward;
                if (w === "3A" || w === "3B") {
                    w = "3A・3B";
                    patientData[key].ward = "3A・3B";
                }
                var found = false;
                for(var j=0; j<predefinedOrder.length; j++) {
                    if (predefinedOrder[j] === w) { found = true; break; }
                }
                if (!found) {
                    otherWards[w] = true;
                }
            }
        }
        
        var otherWardsArr = [];
        for (var k in otherWards) {
            if(otherWards.hasOwnProperty(k)) otherWardsArr.push(k);
        }
        otherWardsArr.sort();
        
        var finalOrder = predefinedOrder.concat(otherWardsArr);
        
        var html = '<span style="font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; margin-right:15px; color:#555;">病棟絞り込み:</span>';
        var hasWard = false;
        
        for (var i = 0; i < finalOrder.length; i++) {
            hasWard = true;
            var w = finalOrder[i];
            var isChecked = checkedWards[w] ? "checked" : "";
            html += '<label class="ward-label"><input type="checkbox" class="ward-cb" value="' + escapeHtml(w) + '" onchange="renderTable()" ' + isChecked + '> ' + escapeHtml(w) + '</label>';
        }
        
        if (!hasWard) html += '<span style="font-size:11px; color:#999;">（データなし）</span>';
        container.innerHTML = html;
    }

    function exportToCSV() {
        if (!fso) {
            alert("ファイル出力機能が利用できない環境です。");
            return;
        }

        var csvContent = "患者ID,氏名,年齢,年齢区分,病棟,診療科,担当医師,対象薬品,投与回数,投与開始,投与終了,採血予定日,冷凍日,ステータス,タブ,備考\n";
        
        var keys = getFilteredKeys();
        for (var k = 0; k < keys.length; k++) {
            var p = patientData[keys[k]];
            
            var currentWard = p.currentWard || p.ward;
            var currentDept = (p.currentDept !== undefined && p.currentDept !== null && p.currentDept !== "") ? p.currentDept : p.department;
            var currentDoctor = (p.currentDoctor !== undefined && p.currentDoctor !== null && p.currentDoctor !== "") ? p.currentDoctor : p.doctor;

            var rowArray = [
                p.id, p.name, p.age, p.ageGroup, currentWard, currentDept, currentDoctor,
                p.drug, p.freq ? p.freq + "回/日" : "", p.start, p.end, p.sampleDate,
                p.freezeDate || "",
                p.status === "" ? "未選択" : p.status, 
                p.tab === "target" ? "対象症例" : (p.tab === "exclude" ? "候補外" : "スクリーニング"),
                p.remarks
            ];
            
            var escapedRow = [];
            for (var i = 0; i < rowArray.length; i++) {
                var str = String(rowArray[i] || "");
                escapedRow.push('"' + str.replace(/"/g, '""') + '"');
            }
            csvContent += escapedRow.join(",") + "\n";
        }
        
        try {
            var d = new Date();
            var y = d.getFullYear();
            var m = d.getMonth() + 1;
            var day = d.getDate();
            var h = d.getHours();
            var min = d.getMinutes();
            var sec = d.getSeconds();
            var dateStr = y + (m < 10 ? '0' + m : m) + (day < 10 ? '0' + day : day) + "_" + (h < 10 ? '0'+h : h) + (min < 10 ? '0'+min : min) + (sec < 10 ? '0'+sec : sec);
            
            var htaPath = unescape(location.pathname).replace(/^\/([a-zA-Z]:)/, '$1').replace(/\//g, '\\');
            var folderPath = fso.GetParentFolderName(htaPath);
            var expPath = folderPath + "\\管理一覧出力_" + dateStr + ".csv";
            
            var ts = fso.CreateTextFile(expPath, true, false); // overwrite=true, unicode=false (ANSI=Shift_JIS)
            ts.Write(csvContent);
            ts.Close();
            
            try {
                var wsh = new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");
                wsh.Run('"' + expPath + '"');
            } catch (err) {
                alert("「" + expPath + "」にCSVを出力しました。");
            }
        } catch (e) {
            alert("CSV出力に失敗しました。\n\n詳細エラー: " + e.message);
        }
    }

    function renderSummary() {
        var summaryDiv = document.getElementById("summary-view");
        var targetDrugs = ["セフトリアキソン", "ユナスピン", "タゾピペ"];
        var ageGroups = ["非高齢者", "高齢者", "超高齢者", "対象外", "未取得"];
        
        var stats = {};
        for (var i=0; i<targetDrugs.length; i++) {
            stats[targetDrugs[i]] = {};
            for(var j=0; j<ageGroups.length; j++) {
                stats[targetDrugs[i]][ageGroups[j]] = [0,0,0,0,0,0,0];
            }
        }

        for(var k in patientData) {
            var p = patientData[k];
            if (p.tab !== "target") continue; 
            
            var matchedDrug = null;
            for(var i=0; i<targetDrugs.length; i++) {
                if (p.drug.indexOf(targetDrugs[i]) !== -1) {
                    matchedDrug = targetDrugs[i];
                    break;
                }
            }
            if (!matchedDrug) continue; 
            
            var ag = p.ageGroup || "未取得";
            if (stats[matchedDrug][ag]) {
                var sIdx = statusLabels.indexOf(p.status);
                if (sIdx === -1) sIdx = statusLabels.length; // Unselected
                stats[matchedDrug][ag][sIdx]++;
            }
        }

        var html = "<h3 style='margin-top:0; border-bottom:2px solid #2980b9; padding-bottom:3px; margin-bottom:10px;'>各抗菌薬の症例集計（※対象症例タブのみ）</h3>";
        
        for(var i=0; i<targetDrugs.length; i++) {
            var drugName = targetDrugs[i];
            html += "<h4 style='color:#2c3e50; margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size:13px;'>" + drugName + "</h4>";
            html += "<table class='summary-table'><thead><tr><th>年齢区分</th>";
            for(var s=0; s<statusLabels.length; s++) {
                html += "<th>" + statusLabels[s] + "</th>";
            }
            html += "<th>未選択</th>";
            html += "<th style='background:#f39c12;'>合計</th></tr></thead><tbody>";
            
            var colTotals = [0,0,0,0,0,0,0];
            var totalCases = 0;

            for(var a=0; a<ageGroups.length; a++) {
                var ag = ageGroups[a];
                html += "<tr><td>" + ag + "</td>";
                var rowTotal = 0;
                for(var s=0; s<=statusLabels.length; s++) {
                    var cnt = stats[drugName][ag][s];
                    html += "<td>" + cnt + "</td>";
                    rowTotal += cnt;
                    colTotals[s] += cnt;
                }
                html += "<td class='summary-total-col'>" + rowTotal + "</td></tr>";
                totalCases += rowTotal;
            }

            html += "<tr class='summary-total-row'><td>総合計</td>";
            for(var s=0; s<=statusLabels.length; s++) {
                html += "<td>" + colTotals[s] + "</td>";
            }
            html += "<td class='summary-total-col'>" + totalCases + "</td></tr>";
            html += "</tbody></table>";
        }

        summaryDiv.innerHTML = html;
    }

    function hasKeys(obj) {
        for (var k in obj) { if(obj.hasOwnProperty(k)) return true; }
        return false;
    }

    function getFilteredKeys() {
        var keys = [];
        var searchInput = document.getElementById("searchInput") ? document.getElementById("searchInput").value.toUpperCase() : "";
        var checkboxes = document.getElementsByClassName('ward-cb');
        var selectedWards = [];
        for(var i=0; i<checkboxes.length; i++) {
            if(checkboxes[i].checked) selectedWards.push(checkboxes[i].value);
        }

        for (var key in patientData) {
            if (!patientData.hasOwnProperty(key)) continue;
            var p = patientData[key];
            
            var pTab = p.tab || "screening";
            if (pTab !== currentTab) continue;
            
            var searchText = (p.id + p.name).toUpperCase();
            if (searchInput !== "" && searchText.indexOf(searchInput) === -1) continue;

            if (selectedWards.length > 0) {
                var wardMatch = false;
                for(var j=0; j<selectedWards.length; j++) {
                    if (p.ward === selectedWards[j]) wardMatch = true;
                }
                if (!wardMatch) continue;
            }

            if (hasKeys(msFilters.age) && !msFilters.age[p.ageGroup]) continue;
            if (hasKeys(msFilters.drug) && !msFilters.drug[p.drug]) continue;
            if (hasKeys(msFilters.status) && !msFilters.status[p.status]) continue;
            var safeDept = p.department || "(未登録)";
            if (hasKeys(msFilters.dept) && !msFilters.dept[safeDept]) continue;

            keys.push(key);
        }

        if (currentSortCol !== "") {
            keys.sort(function(a, b) {
                var vA = patientData[a][currentSortCol];
                var vB = patientData[b][currentSortCol];
                
                if (vA === null || vA === undefined) vA = "";
                if (vB === null || vB === undefined) vB = "";
                
                if (currentSortCol === 'age') {
                    vA = parseInt(vA, 10); if(isNaN(vA)) vA = -1;
                    vB = parseInt(vB, 10); if(isNaN(vB)) vB = -1;
                }

                if(vA < vB) return currentSortAsc ? -1 : 1;
                if(vA > vB) return currentSortAsc ? 1 : -1;
                return 0;
            });
        }
        return keys;
    }

    function renderTable() {
        updateHeaderFilters();

        var tbody = document.getElementById('tableBody');
        var alertList = document.getElementById('alertList');
        var alertSection = document.getElementById('todayAlert');
        var freezeAlertList = document.getElementById('freezeAlertList');
        var freezeAlertSection = document.getElementById('freezeAlert');
        var searchInput = document.getElementById("searchInput") ? document.getElementById("searchInput").value.toUpperCase() : "";
        
        var checkboxes = document.getElementsByClassName('ward-cb');
        var selectedWards = [];
        for(var i=0; i<checkboxes.length; i++) {
            if(checkboxes[i].checked) {
                selectedWards.push(checkboxes[i].value);
            }
        }
        
        var d = new Date();
        var y = d.getFullYear();
        var m = d.getMonth() + 1;
        var day = d.getDate();
        var todayStr = y + '-' + (m < 10 ? '0' + m : m) + '-' + (day < 10 ? '0' + day : day);
        var todayObj = new Date(y, m - 1, day);
        
        tbody.innerHTML = "";
        alertList.innerHTML = "";
        var alertCount = 0;

        if (freezeAlertList) freezeAlertList.innerHTML = "";
        var freezeAlertCount = 0;

        // 冷凍検体の提出リマインド判定（対象症例タブ時）
        if (currentTab === "target") {
            for (var pk in patientData) {
                if (!patientData.hasOwnProperty(pk)) continue;
                var pp = patientData[pk];
                if (pp.status === "冷凍") {
                    var fDateStr = pp.freezeDate || pp.sampleDate;
                    if (fDateStr) {
                        var fDate = parseDateStr(fDateStr);
                        if (fDate) {
                            var diffDays = Math.floor((todayObj.getTime() - fDate.getTime()) / (24 * 60 * 60 * 1000));
                            // 1週間前（23日経過以降）または1か月（30日）超過
                            if (diffDays >= 23) {
                                freezeAlertCount++;
                                if (freezeAlertList) {
                                    var li = document.createElement("li");
                                    var remDays = 30 - diffDays;
                                    var statusText = "";
                                    if (remDays < 0) {
                                        statusText = "<span style='color:#c0392b; font-weight:bold;'>【1か月超過】 " + Math.abs(remDays) + "日超過 (" + diffDays + "日経過)</span>";
                                    } else if (remDays === 0) {
                                        statusText = "<span style='color:#e67e22; font-weight:bold;'>【本日が1か月期限】 (30日経過)</span>";
                                    } else {
                                        statusText = "<span style='color:#d35400; font-weight:bold;'>【まもなく1か月】 残り" + remDays + "日 (" + diffDays + "日経過)</span>";
                                    }
                                    li.innerHTML = "<strong>" + escapeHtml(pp.id) + " " + escapeHtml(pp.name) + "様</strong> (" + escapeHtml(pp.drug) + ", 冷凍日: " + escapeHtml(fDateStr) + ") &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; " + statusText;
                                    freezeAlertList.appendChild(li);
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        var idCounts = {};
        var idInTarget = {};
        for(var k in patientData) {
            if(patientData.hasOwnProperty(k)) {
                var pid = patientData[k].id;
                idCounts[pid] = (idCounts[pid] || 0) + 1;
                if (patientData[k].tab === "target") {
                    idInTarget[pid] = true;
                }
            }
        }

        var keys = getFilteredKeys();

        var sortCols = ["id", "name", "age", "ward", "start", "sampleDate"];
        for (var i=0; i<sortCols.length; i++) {
            var sc = sortCols[i];
            var iconId = "sort-icon-" + sc;
            var el = document.getElementById(iconId);
            if(el) {
                if (currentSortCol === sc) {
                    el.innerHTML = currentSortAsc ? "▲" : "▼";
                    el.style.color = "#f1c40f";
                } else {
                    el.innerHTML = "↕";
                    el.style.color = "#7f8c8d";
                }
            }
        }

        for (var i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {
            var key = keys[i];
            var p = patientData[key];

            var isToday = (p.sampleDate === todayStr);

            if (isToday && currentTab === "target") {
                alertCount++;
                var li = document.createElement("li");
                li.innerHTML = "<strong>" + escapeHtml(p.id) + " " + escapeHtml(p.name) + "様</strong> (" + escapeHtml(p.drug) + ")";
                alertList.appendChild(li);
            }

            var hasMultiple = (idCounts[p.id] > 1);
            var isAlreadyTarget = idInTarget[p.id];

            var row = document.createElement('tr');
            row.id = 'tr-patient-' + key;
            
            var rowClasses = [];
            if (isToday) rowClasses.push("highlight");
            if (hasMultiple) rowClasses.push("multi-drug-row");
            row.className = rowClasses.join(" ");

            var safeWard = escapeHtml(p.ward);
            if (p.currentWard && p.currentWard !== p.ward) {
                safeWard = "<span style='text-decoration:line-through; color:#999;'>" + safeWard + "</span><br><span style='color:#e74c3c; font-weight:bold;'>➡️現在: " + escapeHtml(p.currentWard) + "</span>";
            } else if (p.currentWard && p.currentWard === p.ward) {
                safeWard = safeWard + "<br><span style='color:#27ae60; font-size:10px; font-weight:bold;'>✓現在も" + escapeHtml(p.currentWard) + "</span>";
            }
            
            var deptDisplay = escapeHtml(p.department);
            if (p.currentDept && p.currentDept !== p.department) {
                deptDisplay = "<span style='text-decoration:line-through; color:#999;'>" + deptDisplay + "</span> <span style='color:#e74c3c; font-weight:bold;'>" + escapeHtml(p.currentDept) + "</span>";
            }
            
            var docDisplay = escapeHtml(p.doctor);
            if (p.currentDoctor && p.currentDoctor !== p.doctor) {
                docDisplay = "<span style='text-decoration:line-through; color:#999;'>" + docDisplay + "</span> <span style='color:#e74c3c; font-weight:bold;'>" + escapeHtml(p.currentDoctor) + "</span>";
            }
            
            var infoStr = safeWard + "<br><span style='font-size:10px;color:#555;'>" + deptDisplay + " / " + docDisplay + "</span>";
            var ageDisplay = (p.age !== null && p.age !== "") ? escapeHtml(p.age) + "歳<br><span style='font-size:10px;'>" + escapeHtml(p.ageGroup) + "</span>" : "<span style='color:#ccc; font-size:10px;'>未取得</span>";

            var drugDisplay = escapeHtml(p.drug);
            if (p.freq && p.freq > 0) {
                drugDisplay += " <span style='font-size:10px; color:#34495e; background:#ecf0f1; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; white-space:nowrap;'>(" + p.freq + "回/日)</span>";
            }
            if (isAlreadyTarget && currentTab !== "target") {
                drugDisplay += "<br><span style='display:inline-block; font-size:10px; font-weight:bold; color:white; background:#c0392b; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; margin-top:2px;'>🚨対象症例に登録済</span>";
            } else if (hasMultiple) {
                drugDisplay += "<br><span class='multi-drug-badge'>複数期間(薬剤)あり</span>";
            }

            var isFutureSampleInPeriod = false;
            if (p.sampleDate && p.start && p.end) {
                var sDate = new Date(p.sampleDate);
                var startDate = new Date(p.start);
                var endDate = new Date(p.end);
                
                sDate.setHours(0,0,0,0);
                startDate.setHours(0,0,0,0);
                endDate.setHours(0,0,0,0);
                
                var todayDate = new Date();
                todayDate.setHours(0,0,0,0);
                
                if (sDate > todayDate && sDate >= startDate && sDate <= endDate) {
                    isFutureSampleInPeriod = true;
                }
            }
            var bloodCellStyle = isFutureSampleInPeriod ? "background-color: #ffeaa7; border: 2px solid #fdcb6e;" : "";
            var futureBadge = isFutureSampleInPeriod ? "<span style='display:inline-block; font-size:10px; font-weight:bold; color:#d35400; background:#fad390; padding:2px 4px; border-radius:3px; margin-bottom:2px;'>🌟投与中予定あり</span><br>" : "";

            var html = "";
            html += "<td>" + escapeHtml(p.id) + "</td>";
            html += "<td>" + escapeHtml(p.name) + "</td>";
            html += "<td>" + ageDisplay + "</td>";
            html += "<td>" + infoStr + "</td>";
            html += "<td style='font-size: 11px;'>" + drugDisplay + "</td>";
            html += "<td style='font-size: 11px;'>" + escapeHtml(p.start) + "<br>～" + escapeHtml(p.end) + "</td>";
            
            html += "<td class='blood-date-cell' style='" + bloodCellStyle + "' title='" + escapeHtml(p.bloodDetail) + "'>";
            html += futureBadge;
            html += "  <input type='date' value='" + escapeHtml(p.sampleDate) + "' onchange=\"updateSampleDate('" + key + "', this.value)\" style='width: 105px;'>";
            html += "  <br><button class='fetch-btn' id='btn-" + key + "' onclick=\"fetchSingleBloodDate('" + key + "')\">一括確認(年齢+採血)</button>";
            html += "  <div style='font-size:10px; color:#666; margin-top:2px;' class='blood-date-text'>" + escapeHtml(p.bloodDetail) + "</div>";
            html += "</td>";

            var safeRemarks = p.remarks ? escapeHtml(p.remarks) : "";
            var lines = (p.remarks || "").split(/\r\n|\r|\n/).length;
            var calcHeight = Math.max(45, lines * 15 + 10);
            html += "<td><textarea class='remarks-input' style='height:" + calcHeight + "px;' title='" + safeRemarks + "' ondblclick=\"expandTextarea(this)\" oninput=\"this.style.height='auto';this.style.height=(this.scrollHeight+2)+'px';this.title=this.value\" onchange=\"updateRemarks('" + key + "', this.value)\" placeholder='メモ... ダブルクリックで拡大'>" + safeRemarks + "</textarea></td>";

            html += "<td style='text-align: center;'>";
            html += "  <div class='sub-status-grid'>";
            var subStatusObj = p.subStatus || {};
            for (var st=0; st<subStatusLabels.length; st++) {
                var isActive = subStatusObj[subStatusLabels[st]] ? "active" : "";
                html += "    <div class='sub-status-badge " + isActive + "' onclick=\"toggleSubStatus('" + key + "', '" + subStatusLabels[st] + "')\" title='" + subStatusLabels[st] + "'>" + subStatusAbbr[st] + "</div>";
            }
            html += "  </div>";
            html += "</td>";
            
            html += "<td style='text-align: center;'>";
            html += "  <div class='status-grid'>";
            for (var st=0; st<statusLabels.length; st++) {
                var isActive = (p.status === statusLabels[st]) ? "active st-" + st : "";
                html += "    <div class='status-badge " + isActive + "' onclick=\"updateStatus('" + key + "', '" + statusLabels[st] + "')\">" + statusAbbr[st] + "</div>";
            }
            html += "  </div>";
            html += "</td>";
            
            html += "<td style='text-align: center;'>";
            if (currentTab === "screening") {
                html += "  <button onclick=\"moveTab('" + key + "', 'target')\" style='font-size:10px; background:#2ecc71; color:white; border:none; padding:7px 4px; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; width:100%; margin-bottom:5px;'>対象へ</button>";
                html += "  <br><button onclick=\"moveTab('" + key + "', 'exclude')\" style='font-size:10px; background:#e74c3c; color:white; border:none; padding:7px 4px; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; width:100%;'>候補外へ</button>";
            } else if (currentTab === "target") {
                html += "  <button onclick=\"moveTab('" + key + "', 'screening')\" style='font-size:10px; background:#95a5a6; color:white; border:none; padding:7px 4px; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; width:100%; margin-bottom:5px;'>戻す</button>";
                html += "  <br><button onclick=\"moveTab('" + key + "', 'exclude')\" style='font-size:10px; background:#e74c3c; color:white; border:none; padding:7px 4px; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; width:100%;'>候補外へ</button>";
            } else if (currentTab === "exclude") {
                html += "  <button onclick=\"moveTab('" + key + "', 'screening')\" style='font-size:10px; background:#95a5a6; color:white; border:none; padding:7px 4px; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; width:100%;'>スクへ戻す</button>";
            }
            html += "</td>";
            
            row.innerHTML = html;
            tbody.appendChild(row);
        }

        alertSection.style.display = alertCount > 0 ? "block" : "none";
        if (freezeAlertSection) {
            freezeAlertSection.style.display = (freezeAlertCount > 0 && currentTab === "target") ? "block" : "none";
        }
        setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 30);
    }

    function zeroPadId(id) {
        id = String(id).replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '');
        while(id.length < 7) {
            id = "0" + id;
        }
        return id;
    }

    function checkCurrentInfo() {
        if(isFetchingAll) return;
        
        var filteredKeys = getFilteredKeys();
        
        if (filteredKeys.length === 0) {
            alert("表示されている患者がいません。");
            return;
        }
        
        if (confirm("全病棟(3A-6C)の全体名簿を裏で高速確認し、各患者が現在どの病棟にいるかを一括判定しますか？\n(※数秒〜十数秒かかります)")) {
            isFetchingAll = true;
            var btn = document.getElementById('wardFetchBtn');
            if(btn) { btn.innerText = "名簿確認開始..."; btn.disabled = true; }
            
            var d = new Date();
            var y = d.getFullYear();
            var m = d.getMonth() + 1;
            var day = d.getDate();
            var todayStr = y + "%2F" + (m < 10 ? '0' + m : m) + "%2F" + (day < 10 ? '0' + day : day);
            var userId = "16622";
            
            var wardsMap = [
                {code: 31, name: "3A・3B"}, {code: 32, name: "NICU"}, {code: 33, name: "3C"},
                {code: 42, name: "4B"}, {code: 43, name: "4C"}, {code: 51, name: "5A"},
                {code: 52, name: "5B"}, {code: 53, name: "5C"}, {code: 61, name: "6A"},
                {code: 62, name: "6B"}, {code: 63, name: "6C"}
            ];
            
            var patientWardMap = {};
            var wardIndex = 0;
            
            function processNextWard() {
                if (wardIndex >= wardsMap.length) {
                    var needsSave = false;
                    for (var i = 0; i < filteredKeys.length; i++) {
                        var key = filteredKeys[i];
                        var p = patientData[key];
                        if (p.ward === "外来") continue;
                        
                        var pId = zeroPadId(p.id);
                        if (patientWardMap[pId]) {
                            p.currentWard = patientWardMap[pId];
                            needsSave = true;
                        } else {
                            p.currentWard = "他病棟/退院";
                            p.currentDept = "-";
                            p.currentDoctor = "-";
                            needsSave = true;
                        }
                    }
                    
                    isFetchingAll = false;
                    if(btn) { btn.innerText = "最新情報（病棟/科/医）を再取得"; btn.disabled = false; }
                    
                    if (needsSave) {
                        saveDataToFile();
                        renderTable();
                    }
                    
                    alert("全病棟の確認が完了しました。\n（※診療科・主治医の詳細は年齢や採血予定日の取得時に収集されます）");
                    return;
                }
                
                var wInfo = wardsMap[wardIndex];
                if(btn) { btn.innerText = wInfo.name + "確認中..."; }
                
                var url = "http://10.5.171.42:8082/karte/kanja_ichiran/kanja_ichiran.php?byoto_code=" + wInfo.code + "&search_date=" + todayStr + "&ichiran_code=58&user_id=" + userId + "&section_code=&page_num=0&login_flg=";
                
                var iframe = document.createElement("iframe");
                iframe.style.display = "none";
                iframe.setAttribute("application", "yes");
                document.body.appendChild(iframe);
                
                var isDone = false;
                var fallbackTimer = setTimeout(function() {
                    if (!isDone) {
                        isDone = true;
                        document.body.removeChild(iframe);
                        wardIndex++;
                        processNextWard();
                    }
                }, 10000);
                
                iframe.onload = function() {
                    setTimeout(function() {
                        if (isDone) return;
                        isDone = true;
                        clearTimeout(fallbackTimer);
                        try {
                            var doc = iframe.contentWindow.document;
                            var links = doc.getElementsByTagName("a");
                            for(var i=0; i<links.length; i++) {
                                var href = links[i].href || "";
                                if(href.indexOf("kanja_id=") !== -1) {
                                    var idMatch = href.match(/kanja_id=(\d+)/);
                                    if(idMatch && idMatch[1]) {
                                        var paddedId = zeroPadId(idMatch[1]);
                                        patientWardMap[paddedId] = wInfo.name;
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        } catch(e) {}
                        document.body.removeChild(iframe);
                        wardIndex++;
                        setTimeout(processNextWard, 200);
                    }, 200);
                };
                iframe.src = url;
            }
            
            processNextWard();
        }
    }

    function processInfoFetchQueue() {
        if(fetchQueue.length === 0) {
            isFetchingAll = false;
            var btn = document.getElementById('wardFetchBtn');
            if(btn) { btn.innerText = "最新情報（病棟/科/医）を再取得"; btn.disabled = false; }
            alert("基本情報の取得が完了しました。");
            return;
        }
        var nextKey = fetchQueue.shift();
        fetchSingleInfo(nextKey, processInfoFetchQueue, "情報確認中..."); 
    }

    function fetchMissingAges() {
        if(isFetchingAll) return;
        
        var filteredKeys = getFilteredKeys();
        fetchQueue = [];
        for (var i = 0; i < filteredKeys.length; i++) {
            var key = filteredKeys[i];
            var p = patientData[key];
            if (!p.age || p.ageGroup === "未取得") {
                fetchQueue.push(key);
            }
        }
        
        if (fetchQueue.length === 0) {
            alert("現在表示されているリストの中に、年齢が未取得の患者はいません。");
            return;
        }
        
        if (confirm("表示されている未取得の患者 " + fetchQueue.length + " 名の年齢情報を取得しますか？\n(※採血予定日は取得しません)")) {
            isFetchingAll = true;
            processAgeFetchQueue();
        }
    }

    function processAgeFetchQueue() {
        if(fetchQueue.length === 0) {
            isFetchingAll = false;
            alert("年齢の取得が完了しました。");
            return;
        }
        var nextKey = fetchQueue.shift();
        fetchSingleInfo(nextKey, processAgeFetchQueue, "年齢取得中..."); 
    }

    function fetchSingleInfo(key, callback, labelText) {
        var p = patientData[key];
        if (!p || !p.id) {
            if (callback) callback();
            return;
        }
        
        var btn = document.getElementById('btn-' + key);
        if(btn) { btn.innerText = labelText || "取得中..."; btn.disabled = true; }

        var userId = "16622";
        var paddedId = zeroPadId(p.id);
        var searchId = encodeURIComponent(p.id);
        
        var url1 = "http://10.5.171.42:8082/karte/kanja_ichiran/kanja_ichiran.php?kanja_id=" + searchId + 
                   "&ichiran_code=31&user_id=" + userId + "&section_code=0000022&page_num=0&login_flg=";
                   
        var iframeId = "fetch-iframe-" + key;
        var existing = document.getElementById(iframeId);
        if (existing && existing.parentNode) existing.parentNode.removeChild(existing);

        var iframe = document.createElement("iframe");
        iframe.id = iframeId;
        iframe.style.display = "none";
        iframe.setAttribute("application", "yes"); 
        document.body.appendChild(iframe);

        var isDone = false;
        
        var cleanup = function() {
            if (isDone) return;
            isDone = true;
            setTimeout(function() {
                var ifr = document.getElementById(iframeId);
                if (ifr && ifr.parentNode) ifr.parentNode.removeChild(ifr);
                if (callback) callback();
            }, 500);
            if(btn) { btn.innerText = "一括確認(年齢+採血)"; btn.disabled = false; }
            saveAndRender(); 
        };

        var fallbackTimer = setTimeout(function() {
            if (!isDone) {
                if(!p.bloodDetail) p.bloodDetail = "年齢取得T/O";
                cleanup();
            }
        }, 15000); 

        iframe.onload = function() {
            setTimeout(function() {
                if (isDone) return;
                try {
                    var doc = iframe.contentWindow.document;
                    function findPatientRow(currentDoc) {
                        if (!currentDoc) return null;
                        try {
                            var trs = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("tr");
                            for(var i=0; i<trs.length; i++) {
                                var tr = trs[i];
                                var tds = tr.getElementsByTagName("td");
                                if (tds.length >= 12) {
                                    var idText = tds[2].innerText || tds[2].textContent || "";
                                    if (idText.indexOf(paddedId) !== -1 || idText.indexOf(p.id) !== -1) {
                                        return tds;
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        } catch(e) {}
                        
                        var frames = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("frame");
                        var iframes = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("iframe");
                        for(var j=0; j<frames.length; j++) { try { var row = findPatientRow(frames[j].contentWindow.document); if (row) return row; } catch(e){} }
                        for(var k=0; k<iframes.length; k++) { try { var row = findPatientRow(iframes[k].contentWindow.document); if (row) return row; } catch(e){} }
                        return null;
                    }

                    var patientTds = findPatientRow(doc);
                    var match = null;
                    
                    if (patientTds) {
                        var bdText = patientTds[4].innerText || patientTds[4].textContent || "";
                        match = bdText.match(/((?:18|19|20)\d{2})[\/\年]\s*(\d{1,2})[\/\月]\s*(\d{1,2})/);
                        
                        var wardText = (patientTds[8].innerText || patientTds[8].textContent || "").replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '').replace(/　/g, '');
                        var deptText = (patientTds[10].innerText || patientTds[10].textContent || "").replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '').replace(/　/g, '');
                        var docText = (patientTds[11].innerText || patientTds[11].textContent || "").replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '').replace(/　/g, '');
                        
                        if (wardText) p.currentWard = wardText;
                        if (deptText) p.currentDept = deptText;
                        if (docText) p.currentDoctor = docText;
                    } else {
                        var allText = "";
                        function collectText(currentDoc) {
                            if (!currentDoc) return;
                            try { if (currentDoc.body && currentDoc.body.innerText) allText += " " + currentDoc.body.innerText; } catch(e) {}
                            var frames = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("frame");
                            var iframes = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("iframe");
                            for(var j=0; j<frames.length; j++) { try { collectText(frames[j].contentWindow.document); } catch(e){} }
                            for(var k=0; k<iframes.length; k++) { try { collectText(iframes[k].contentWindow.document); } catch(e){} }
                        }
                        collectText(doc);
    
                        var idx = allText.indexOf(paddedId);
                        var searchText = idx !== -1 ? allText.substring(idx) : allText;
                        
                        var bdIdx = searchText.indexOf("生年月日");
                        if (bdIdx !== -1) {
                            searchText = searchText.substring(bdIdx);
                        }
                        
                        match = searchText.match(/((?:18|19|20)\d{2})[\/\年]\s*(\d{1,2})[\/\月]\s*(\d{1,2})/);
                        
                        if (match && bdIdx === -1) {
                            var regexAll = /((?:18|19|20)\d{2})[\/\年]\s*(\d{1,2})[\/\月]\s*(\d{1,2})/g;
                            var mAll;
                            var currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
                            while ((mAll = regexAll.exec(searchText)) !== null) {
                                var yCheck = parseInt(mAll[1], 10);
                                if (yCheck < currentYear - 15) { 
                                    match = mAll;
                                    break;
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }

                    if (match) {
                        var y = parseInt(match[1], 10);
                        var m = parseInt(match[2], 10);
                        var d = parseInt(match[3], 10);
                        p.birthDate = y + "/" + (m<10?'0'+m:m) + "/" + (d<10?'0'+d:d);
                        p.age = calculateAgeAtStart(p.birthDate, p.start);
                        p.ageGroup = getAgeGroup(p.age);
                    }
                    
                    clearTimeout(fallbackTimer);
                    cleanup();
                } catch(e) {
                    clearTimeout(fallbackTimer);
                    cleanup();
                }
            }, 1500); 
        };
        
        try {
            iframe.src = url1;
        } catch(e) {
            clearTimeout(fallbackTimer);
            cleanup();
        }
    }

    function fetchAllBloodDates() {
        if(isFetchingAll) return;
        
        var filteredKeys = getFilteredKeys();
        fetchQueue = [];
        
        var todayDate = new Date();
        todayDate.setHours(0,0,0,0);
        
        for (var i = 0; i < filteredKeys.length; i++) {
            var key = filteredKeys[i];
            var p = patientData[key];
            
            var endDate = new Date(p.end);
            endDate.setHours(0,0,0,0);
            
            if (!isNaN(endDate.getTime()) && endDate < todayDate) {
                continue;
            }

            fetchQueue.push(key);
        }
        
        if (fetchQueue.length === 0) {
            alert("取得対象の患者がいません。");
            return;
        }
        
        if (confirm("現在表示されている " + fetchQueue.length + " 件の生年月日と採血予定日を一括取得しますか？\n※順次カルテシステムにアクセスするため時間がかかります。")) {
            isFetchingAll = true;
            processFetchQueue();
        }
    }

    function processFetchQueue() {
        if(fetchQueue.length === 0) {
            isFetchingAll = false;
            alert("一括取得が完了しました。");
            return;
        }
        var nextKey = fetchQueue.shift();
        fetchSingleBloodDate(nextKey, processFetchQueue); 
    }

    function fetchSingleBloodDate(key, callback) {
        var p = patientData[key];
        if (!p || !p.id) {
            if (callback) callback();
            return;
        }
        
        var btn = document.getElementById('btn-' + key);
        if(btn) { btn.innerText = "取得中..."; btn.disabled = true; }

        var userId = "16622";
        var paddedId = zeroPadId(p.id);
        var searchId = encodeURIComponent(p.id);
        
        var url1 = "http://10.5.171.42:8082/karte/kanja_ichiran/kanja_ichiran.php?kanja_id=" + searchId + 
                   "&ichiran_code=31&user_id=" + userId + "&section_code=0000022&page_num=0&login_flg=";
                   
        var url2 = "http://10.5.171.42:8082/karte/karte.php?kanja_id=" + searchId + 
                   "&user_id=" + userId + "&order_search_flg=1&order_search_code=3&order_search_name=#top" +
                   "&_nocache=" + new Date().getTime();

        var iframeId = "fetch-iframe-" + key;
        var existing = document.getElementById(iframeId);
        if (existing && existing.parentNode) existing.parentNode.removeChild(existing);

        var iframe = document.createElement("iframe");
        iframe.id = iframeId;
        iframe.style.display = "none";
        iframe.setAttribute("application", "yes"); 
        document.body.appendChild(iframe);

        var step = 1;
        var isDone = false;
        
        var cleanup = function() {
            if (isDone) return;
            isDone = true;
            setTimeout(function() {
                var ifr = document.getElementById(iframeId);
                if (ifr && ifr.parentNode) ifr.parentNode.removeChild(ifr);
                if (callback) callback();
            }, 500);
            saveAndRender(); 
        };

        var fallbackTimer = setTimeout(function() {
            if (!isDone) {
                p.bloodDetail = step === 1 ? "年齢取得T/O" : "採血取得T/O";
                cleanup();
            }
        }, 30000); 

        iframe.onload = function() {
            setTimeout(function() {
                if (isDone) return;
                try {
                    var doc = iframe.contentWindow.document;
                    var allText = "";
                    
                    function collectText(currentDoc) {
                        if (!currentDoc) return;
                        try { if (currentDoc.body && currentDoc.body.innerText) allText += " " + currentDoc.body.innerText; } catch(e) {}
                        var frames = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("frame");
                        var iframes = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("iframe");
                        for(var j=0; j<frames.length; j++) { try { collectText(frames[j].contentWindow.document); } catch(e){} }
                        for(var k=0; k<iframes.length; k++) { try { collectText(iframes[k].contentWindow.document); } catch(e){} }
                    }
                    collectText(doc);

                    if (step === 1) {
                        function findPatientRow(currentDoc) {
                            if (!currentDoc) return null;
                            try {
                                var trs = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("tr");
                                for(var i=0; i<trs.length; i++) {
                                    var tr = trs[i];
                                    var tds = tr.getElementsByTagName("td");
                                    if (tds.length >= 12) {
                                        var idText = tds[2].innerText || tds[2].textContent || "";
                                        if (idText.indexOf(paddedId) !== -1 || idText.indexOf(p.id) !== -1) {
                                            return tds;
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            } catch(e) {}
                            
                            var frames = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("frame");
                            var iframes = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("iframe");
                            for(var j=0; j<frames.length; j++) { try { var row = findPatientRow(frames[j].contentWindow.document); if (row) return row; } catch(e){} }
                            for(var k=0; k<iframes.length; k++) { try { var row = findPatientRow(iframes[k].contentWindow.document); if (row) return row; } catch(e){} }
                            return null;
                        }

                        var patientTds = findPatientRow(doc);
                        var match = null;
                        
                        if (patientTds) {
                            var bdText = patientTds[4].innerText || patientTds[4].textContent || "";
                            match = bdText.match(/((?:18|19|20)\d{2})[\/\年]\s*(\d{1,2})[\/\月]\s*(\d{1,2})/);
                            
                            var wardText = (patientTds[8].innerText || patientTds[8].textContent || "").replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '').replace(/　/g, '');
                            var deptText = (patientTds[10].innerText || patientTds[10].textContent || "").replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '').replace(/　/g, '');
                            var docText = (patientTds[11].innerText || patientTds[11].textContent || "").replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '').replace(/　/g, '');
                            
                            if (wardText) p.currentWard = wardText;
                            if (deptText) p.currentDept = deptText;
                            if (docText) p.currentDoctor = docText;
                        } else {
                            var allText = "";
                            function collectText(currentDoc) {
                                if (!currentDoc) return;
                                try { if (currentDoc.body && currentDoc.body.innerText) allText += " " + currentDoc.body.innerText; } catch(e) {}
                                var frames = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("frame");
                                var iframes = currentDoc.getElementsByTagName("iframe");
                                for(var j=0; j<frames.length; j++) { try { collectText(frames[j].contentWindow.document); } catch(e){} }
                                for(var k=0; k<iframes.length; k++) { try { collectText(iframes[k].contentWindow.document); } catch(e){} }
                            }
                            collectText(doc);
                            
                            var idx = allText.indexOf(paddedId);
                            var searchText = idx !== -1 ? allText.substring(idx) : allText;
                            
                            var bdIdx = searchText.indexOf("生年月日");
                            if (bdIdx !== -1) {
                                searchText = searchText.substring(bdIdx);
                            }
                            
                            match = searchText.match(/((?:18|19|20)\d{2})[\/\年]\s*(\d{1,2})[\/\月]\s*(\d{1,2})/);
                            
                            if (match && bdIdx === -1) {
                                var regexAll = /((?:18|19|20)\d{2})[\/\年]\s*(\d{1,2})[\/\月]\s*(\d{1,2})/g;
                                var mAll;
                                var currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
                                while ((mAll = regexAll.exec(searchText)) !== null) {
                                    var yCheck = parseInt(mAll[1], 10);
                                    if (yCheck < currentYear - 15) { 
                                        match = mAll;
                                        break;
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }

                        if (match) {
                            var y = parseInt(match[1], 10);
                            var m = parseInt(match[2], 10);
                            var d = parseInt(match[3], 10);
                            p.birthDate = y + "/" + (m<10?'0'+m:m) + "/" + (d<10?'0'+d:d);
                            p.age = calculateAgeAtStart(p.birthDate, p.start);
                            p.ageGroup = getAgeGroup(p.age);
                        }
                        
                        step = 2;
                        iframe.src = url2; 
                    } else if (step === 2) {
                        var regex = /【([^】]*?(?:生化学|血液|外注|一般)[^】]*?)】[^【]{0,150}?(\d{4})\/(\d{2})\/(\d{2})/g;
                        var match;
                        var today = new Date();
                        today.setHours(0,0,0,0);
                        var futureEntries = [];
                        
                        while ((match = regex.exec(allText)) !== null) {
                            var typeRaw = match[1].replace(/^[0-9:\s]+/, '').replace(/\[.*?\]\s*/g, '').replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '');
                            var typeClean = typeRaw.substring(0, 15);
                            var y = parseInt(match[2], 10);
                            var m = parseInt(match[3], 10);
                            var d = parseInt(match[4], 10);
                            var dt = new Date(y, m - 1, d);
                            
                            var diffDays = (dt.getTime() - today.getTime()) / (1000 * 3600 * 24);
                            if (diffDays >= 0 && diffDays <= 30) {
                                var mStr = m < 10 ? '0' + m : m;
                                var dStr = d < 10 ? '0' + d : d;
                                futureEntries.push({
                                    dateObj: dt,
                                    displayDate: y + '-' + mStr + '-' + dStr,
                                    detail: typeClean
                                });
                            }
                        }
                        
                        if (futureEntries.length > 0) {
                            futureEntries.sort(function(a, b) { return a.dateObj.getTime() - b.dateObj.getTime(); });
                            var target = futureEntries[0];
                            p.sampleDate = target.displayDate;
                            
                            var todayStrLocal = today.getFullYear() + '-' + ((today.getMonth()+1)<10?'0':'')+(today.getMonth()+1) + '-' + (today.getDate()<10?'0':'')+today.getDate();
                            
                            if (target.displayDate === todayStrLocal && futureEntries.length > 1) {
                                var nextTarget = futureEntries[1];
                                p.bloodDetail = "予定有 (今日:" + target.detail + " / 次回:" + nextTarget.displayDate.substring(5).replace('-', '/') + " " + nextTarget.detail + ")";
                            } else {
                                p.bloodDetail = "予定有 (" + target.detail + ")";
                            }
                        } else {
                            p.bloodDetail = "30日以内の予定なし";
                        }
                        
                        clearTimeout(fallbackTimer);
                        cleanup();
                    }
                } catch(e) {
                    var err = String(e.message || e);
                    p.bloodDetail = (step === 1 ? "年齢Err:" : "解析Err:") + err.substring(0, 10);
                    clearTimeout(fallbackTimer);
                    cleanup();
                }
            }, 1500); 
        };
        
        try {
            iframe.src = url1;
        } catch(e) {
            p.bloodDetail = "URLエラー";
            clearTimeout(fallbackTimer);
            cleanup();
        }
    }
    function renderCRF() {
        var html = '<div id="crf-controls-area" style="margin-bottom:8px;">';
        html += '<h3 style="margin-top:0; margin-bottom:6px;">提出済・冷凍患者用 CRFデータシート</h3>';
        html += '<button onclick="addCrfColumn()" style="background:#3498db; color:white; border:none; padding:5px 10px; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer;">＋ 列を追加</button> ';
        html += '<button onclick="exportCRFToCSV()" class="export-btn" style="background:#27ae60;">CRFをCSV出力</button>';
        html += '</div>';

        html += '<div id="crfTableScrollWrap" onscroll="fixCrfTableHeader()">';
        html += '<table id="crfTable" style="table-layout: auto; min-width: 100%;">';
        html += '<thead><tr>';
        html += '<th style="min-width: 50px;">並び替え</th>';
        html += '<th style="min-width: 70px;">患者ID</th>';
        html += '<th style="min-width: 80px;">氏名</th>';
        html += '<th style="min-width: 120px;">対象薬品</th>';
        
        for (var i = 0; i < crfColumns.length; i++) {
            html += '<th style="min-width: 150px;">' + escapeHtml(crfColumns[i]) + '<br>';
            html += '<div style="margin-top:3px;">';
            if (i > 0) html += '<button onclick="moveCrfColumn(' + i + ', -1)" style="font-size:10px; background:#95a5a6; color:white; border:none; padding:1px 3px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; margin-right:3px;">◀</button>';
            html += '<button onclick="renameCrfColumn(\'' + escapeHtml(crfColumns[i]).replace(/'/g, "\\'") + '\')" style="font-size:10px; background:#f39c12; color:white; border:none; padding:1px 3px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; margin-right:3px;">編集</button>';
            html += '<button onclick="removeCrfColumn(\'' + escapeHtml(crfColumns[i]).replace(/'/g, "\\'") + '\')" style="font-size:10px; background:#e74c3c; color:white; border:none; padding:1px 3px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; margin-right:3px;">削除</button>';
            if (i < crfColumns.length - 1) html += '<button onclick="moveCrfColumn(' + i + ', 1)" style="font-size:10px; background:#95a5a6; color:white; border:none; padding:1px 3px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer;">▶</button>';
            html += '</div></th>';
        }
        
        html += '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        
        var crfPatients = [];
        for (var key in patientData) {
            if (!patientData.hasOwnProperty(key)) continue;
            var p = patientData[key];
            if (p.tab === "target" && (p.status === "提出済" || p.status === "冷凍")) {
                if (typeof p.crfSortIndex === "undefined") {
                    p.crfSortIndex = new Date().getTime() + Math.random(); 
                }
                crfPatients.push({key: key, data: p});
            }
        }
        crfPatients.sort(function(a, b) {
            return (a.data.crfSortIndex || 0) - (b.data.crfSortIndex || 0);
        });
        
        for (var i = 0; i < crfPatients.length; i++) {
            crfPatients[i].data.crfSortIndex = i;
            var item = crfPatients[i];
            var p = item.data;
            html += '<tr>';
            html += '<td style="text-align:center;">';
            if (i > 0) html += '<button onclick="moveCrfRow(' + i + ', -1)" style="font-size:12px; background:#7f8c8d; color:white; border:none; padding:2px 5px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; margin-bottom:2px; width:100%;">▲</button><br>';
            if (i < crfPatients.length - 1) html += '<button onclick="moveCrfRow(' + i + ', 1)" style="font-size:12px; background:#7f8c8d; color:white; border:none; padding:2px 5px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; width:100%;">▼</button>';
            html += '</td>';
            html += '<td>' + escapeHtml(p.id) + '</td>';
            html += '<td>' + escapeHtml(p.name) + '</td>';
            html += '<td>' + escapeHtml(p.drug) + '</td>';
            
            var cData = p.crfData || {};
            for (var c = 0; c < crfColumns.length; c++) {
                var colName = crfColumns[c];
                var val = cData[colName] || "";
                var lines = val.split(/\r\n|\r|\n/).length;
                var calcHeight = Math.max(45, lines * 15 + 10);
                html += '<td><textarea class="remarks-input" style="height:' + calcHeight + 'px;" title="' + escapeHtml(val) + '" ondblclick="expandTextarea(this)" oninput="this.style.height=\'auto\';this.style.height=(this.scrollHeight+2)+\'px\';this.title=this.value" onchange="updateCrfData(\'' + item.key + '\', \'' + escapeHtml(colName).replace(/'/g, "\\'") + '\', this.value)" placeholder="ダブルクリックで拡大">' + escapeHtml(val) + '</textarea></td>';
            }
            html += '</tr>';
        }
        
        html += '</tbody></table>';
        html += '</div>';
        document.getElementById('crf-view').innerHTML = html;
        updateLayoutHeights();
        fixCrfTableHeader();
        saveDataToFile();
    }

    function moveCrfColumn(idx, direction) {
        if (idx + direction < 0 || idx + direction >= crfColumns.length) return;
        var temp = crfColumns[idx];
        crfColumns[idx] = crfColumns[idx + direction];
        crfColumns[idx + direction] = temp;
        saveColumns();
        renderCRF();
    }

    function moveCrfRow(index, direction) {
        var crfPatients = [];
        for (var key in patientData) {
            if (patientData.hasOwnProperty(key)) {
                var p = patientData[key];
                if (p.tab === "target" && (p.status === "提出済" || p.status === "冷凍")) {
                    crfPatients.push({key: key, data: p});
                }
            }
        }
        crfPatients.sort(function(a, b) {
            return (a.data.crfSortIndex || 0) - (b.data.crfSortIndex || 0);
        });

        var targetIdx = index + direction;
        if (targetIdx < 0 || targetIdx >= crfPatients.length) return;

        var tempIndex = crfPatients[index].data.crfSortIndex;
        crfPatients[index].data.crfSortIndex = crfPatients[targetIdx].data.crfSortIndex;
        crfPatients[targetIdx].data.crfSortIndex = tempIndex;

        saveDataToFile();
        renderCRF();
    }

    function addCrfColumn() {
        var colName = prompt("新しい列名を入力してください:");
        if (!colName) return;
        colName = colName.replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '');
        if (colName === "") return;
        if (crfColumns.indexOf(colName) !== -1) {
            alert("その列名はすでに存在します。");
            return;
        }
        crfColumns.push(colName);
        saveColumns();
        renderCRF();
    }

    function removeCrfColumn(colName) {
        if (!confirm("列「" + colName + "」を削除しますか？\n(※この列に入力されているデータも完全に削除されます)")) return;
        var idx = crfColumns.indexOf(colName);
        if (idx !== -1) {
            crfColumns.splice(idx, 1);
            saveColumns();
            
            for (var key in patientData) {
                if (patientData.hasOwnProperty(key)) {
                    var p = patientData[key];
                    if (p.crfData && p.crfData.hasOwnProperty(colName)) {
                        delete p.crfData[colName];
                    }
                }
            }
            saveDataToFile();
            renderCRF();
        }
    }

    function renameCrfColumn(oldName) {
        var newName = prompt("列「" + oldName + "」の新しい名前を入力してください:", oldName);
        if (!newName) return;
        newName = newName.replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, '');
        if (newName === "" || newName === oldName) return;
        
        if (crfColumns.indexOf(newName) !== -1) {
            alert("その列名はすでに存在します。");
            return;
        }
        
        var idx = crfColumns.indexOf(oldName);
        if (idx !== -1) {
            crfColumns[idx] = newName;
            saveColumns();
            
            for (var key in patientData) {
                if (patientData.hasOwnProperty(key)) {
                    var p = patientData[key];
                    if (p.crfData && p.crfData.hasOwnProperty(oldName)) {
                        p.crfData[newName] = p.crfData[oldName];
                        delete p.crfData[oldName];
                    }
                }
            }
            saveDataToFile();
            renderCRF();
        }
    }

    function updateCrfData(key, colName, val) {
        if (!patientData[key].crfData) {
            patientData[key].crfData = {};
        }
        patientData[key].crfData[colName] = val;
        saveDataToFile();
    }

    function exportCRFToCSV() {
        if (!fso) {
            alert("ファイルシステムにアクセスできません。");
            return;
        }
        
        var header = ["患者ID", "氏名", "対象薬品"].concat(crfColumns);
        var csvContent = header.join(",") + "\n";
        
        var crfPatients = [];
        for (var k in patientData) {
            if (patientData.hasOwnProperty(k)) {
                var p = patientData[k];
                if (p.tab === "target" && (p.status === "提出済" || p.status === "冷凍")) {
                    crfPatients.push(p);
                }
            }
        }
        crfPatients.sort(function(a, b) {
            return (a.crfSortIndex || 0) - (b.crfSortIndex || 0);
        });
        
        for (var j = 0; j < crfPatients.length; j++) {
            var p = crfPatients[j];
            var row = [
                '"' + String(p.id).replace(/"/g, '""') + '"',
                '"' + String(p.name).replace(/"/g, '""') + '"',
                '"' + String(p.drug).replace(/"/g, '""') + '"'
            ];
            var cData = p.crfData || {};
            for (var i = 0; i < crfColumns.length; i++) {
                var val = cData[crfColumns[i]] || "";
                var valClean = String(val).replace(/"/g, '""');
                row.push('"' + valClean + '"');
            }
            csvContent += row.join(",") + "\n";
        }
        
        try {
            var d = new Date();
            var y = d.getFullYear();
            var m = d.getMonth() + 1;
            var day = d.getDate();
            var h = d.getHours();
            var min = d.getMinutes();
            var sec = d.getSeconds();
            
            var htaPath = unescape(location.pathname).replace(/^\/([a-zA-Z]:)/, '$1').replace(/\//g, '\\');
            var folderPath = fso.GetParentFolderName(htaPath);
            var filename = folderPath + "\\CRF_Output_" + y + (m < 10 ? '0'+m : m) + (day < 10 ? '0'+day : day) + "_" + (h < 10 ? '0'+h : h) + (min < 10 ? '0'+min : min) + (sec < 10 ? '0'+sec : sec) + ".csv";
            
            var ts = fso.CreateTextFile(filename, true, false); // overwrite=true, unicode=false (ANSI=Shift_JIS)
            ts.Write(csvContent);
            ts.Close();
            
            try {
                var wsh = new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");
                wsh.Run('"' + filename + '"');
            } catch (err) {
                alert("CRFデータをCSVで保存しました。\n保存先: " + filename);
            }
        } catch(e) {
            alert("CSV保存に失敗しました。\n\n詳細エラー: " + e.message);
        }
    }
    updateHeaderFilters(true);
    updateWardCheckboxes();
    renderTable();
    updateLayoutHeights();
    setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 50);
    setTimeout(updateLayoutHeights, 200);
    window.onload = function() {
        updateLayoutHeights();
    };
</script>
</body>
</html>
